#: ../../functions/func_right.rst:6
msgid "$right"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_right.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$right(text,number)**"
msgstr "用法：**$right(text,number)**"

#: ../../functions/func_right.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_right.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_right.rst:13
msgid "Returns the last ``number`` characters from ``text``. If ``number`` is less than 1, then the value used is the number of characters in ``text`` plus ``number`` (e.g.: ``$right(abcd,0)`` is the same as ``$right(abcd,4)``). If ``number`` is missing or a negative number greater than the number of characters in ``text``, the function will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"返回 ``text`` 的最后 ``number`` 个字符。如果 ``number`` 小于 1，则使用的值为 "
"``text`` 的字符数加 ``number``（例如：``$right(abcd,0)`` 与 ``$right(abcd,4)"
"`` 相同）。如果 ``number`` 缺失或为大于 ``text`` 字符数的负数，函数将返回空字"
"符串。"

#: ../../functions/func_right.rst:16
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

